{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2023-04-10 06:50:00', 'title': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. ANNOUNCES THE APPOINTMENT OF ROBERT MATHIS AS CHIEF LEGAL OFFICER', 'text': 'DAYTONA BEACH, FLA., APRIL 10, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE:BRO) (THE “COMPANY”) HAS ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF ROBERT MATHIS AS CHIEF LEGAL OFFICER FOR BROWN & BROWN. MATHIS WILL ALSO SERVE ON THE SENIOR LEADERSHIP TEAM.'}